index 00000000000..29135efd13e
--- /dev/null
+++ b/.upgradenotes/MDL-89778-2026102412000000.yml
@@ -0,0 +1,12 @@
+issueNumber: MDL-89778
+notes:
+  core_course:
+    - message: >-
+        When asynchronous course deletion is enabled, the `pre_course_delete`
+        plugin callbacks and the `\core_course\hook\before_course_deleted` hook
+        are no longer run when the course is queued for deletion. They now run
+        only once, when the queued `\core_course\task\course_async_deletion`
+        ad hoc task actually deletes the course. Previously they were run
+        twice (once when queued and once when deleted), so for example the
+        recycle bin stored two copies of the course.
+      type: changed
